{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combo Overload</strong> is a short abstract incremental game, about defeating enemies to upgrade yourself to the max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/Gif_1.gif?t=1750195882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your resources on a huge <strong>skill tree</strong>, with over a <u>100 upgrades</u> to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/screenshot_skill_tree.png?t=1750195882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build up the\u00a0<strong>combo</strong>\u00a0by defating enemies, but be careful, you'll lose <strong>combo</strong> when getting damaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/extras/combo.gif?t=1750195882\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Contents</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 upgrades</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of levels to clear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple enemy types</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618590?t=1750195882","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/3f4b8f6fde22f3d7d03c1fccde4851d50030cfef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750195882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/9c8a05cb48a9d14679f7d44be310a13a19a868de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750195882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618590/9c8a05cb48a9d14679f7d44be310a13a19a868de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750195882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","